            "id": 78183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operator adds to a variable's value?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>-</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>+=</code> operator adds to a variable's value and stores the result.</p><p>The variable <code>coins</code> stores <code>7</code>. Which line changes its value to <code>12</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>coins += 5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>coins = 5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>coins + 5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>coins += 5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
