            "title": "Question: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 78215,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>199</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why does this code display <code>199</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>speed -= 1</code> subtracts <code>1</code> from <code>200</code> and stores the result.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed -= 1</code> adds 1 to 200 and stores 201.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed -= 1</code> replaces 200 with 1.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>speed -= 1</code> subtracts <code>1</code> from <code>200</code> and stores the result.</p></body></html>",
